e increases and decreases"], "O2": ["10.2", 0, 300, "Using a multiplier"]}, "sources": [], "tests": {"A": [{"id": "m8u10v3Aq01", "type": "num", "prompt": "In a park there are 80 trees. 28 of them are pine trees. What percentage of the trees are pine trees?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Application", "pts": 1, "sec": "A · Fluency", "unit": "%", "units": ["%"]}, {"id": "m8u10v3Aq02", "type": "num", "prompt": "To decrease a value by 24% you multiply by a decimal. Write the decimal.", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Application", "pts": 1, "sec": "A · Fluency", "unit": "×", "units": ["×"], "bare": true}, {"id": "m8u10v3Aq03", "type": "num", "prompt": "Find 1.5% of 40 m.", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Application", "pts": 1, "sec": "A · Fluency", "unit": "m", "units": ["m"]}, {"id": "m8u10v3Aq04", "type": "num", "prompt": "The value of a stamp collection increases by 10% every year. Its value now is $5000. Find its value after one year.", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Application", "pts": 1, "sec": "A · Fluency", "unit": "$", "units": ["$"]}, {"id": "m8u10v3Aq05", "type": "num", "prompt": "Multiplying a value by 0.85 decreases it by what percentage?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Application", "pts": 1, "sec": "A · Fluency", "unit": "%", "units": ["%"]}, {"id": "m8u10v3Aq06", "type": "num", "prompt": "Decrease 2800 by 15%.", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Application", "pts": 1, "sec": "A · Fluency", "unit": "×", "units": ["×"], "bare": true}, {"id": "m8u10v3Aq07", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "A $100 jacket is on sale. Shop A takes 15% off. Shop B takes $30 off. Which is cheaper?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Reasoning", "pts": 1, "sec": "A · Fluency", "options": [{"t": "Shop A"}, {"t": "They are the same"}, {"t": "Shop B"}]}, {"id": "m8u10v3Aq08", "type": "num", "prompt": "A bike costs $170. In a sale the price is reduced by 25%. Find the sale price.", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Application", "pts": 1, "sec": "A · Fluency", "unit": "$", "units": ["$"]}, {"id": "m8u10v3Aq09", "type": "num", "prompt": "Sales tax of 20% is added to a price of $20. Use a multiplier to find the price including tax.", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Application", "pts": 1, "sec": "B · Methods", "unit": "$", "units": ["$"]}, {"id": "m8u10v3Aq10", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Find each answer.", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Data", "pts": 2, "sec": "B · Methods", "cols": ["88", "30", "40", "54", "50", "90"], "mode": "classify", "rows": [{"l": "Increase 80 by 10%"}, {"l": "Decrease 40 by 25%"}, {"l": "Decrease 80 by 50%"}, {"l": "Decrease 60 by 10%"}]}, {"id": "m8u10v3Aq11", "type": "num", "prompt": "$5000 is saved in a bank that adds 2% interest at the end of the year. Use a multiplier to find the amount after 1 year.", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Application", "pts": 1, "sec": "B · Methods", "unit": "$", "units": ["$"]}, {"id": "m8u10v3Aq12", "type": "num", "prompt": "A puppy has a mass of 5.1 kg. It gains 15% in a month. What is its new mass in kg?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Application", "pts": 1, "sec": "B · Methods", "unit": "kg", "units": ["kg"]}, {"id": "m8u10v3Aq13", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Multiplying by 0.75 is the same as…", "diff": "M", "obj": "O2", "skill": "Reasoning", "pts": 1, "sec": "B · Methods", "options": [{"t": "a decrease of 75%"}, {"t": "an increase of 25%"}, {"t": "a decrease of 25%"}, {"t": "a decrease of 0.75%"}]}, {"id": "m8u10v3Aq14", "type": "num", "prompt": "A worker earns $3300 a month. She gets a 2% pay rise. How much does she earn now?", "diff": "M", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Application", "pts": 1, "sec": "B · Methods", "unit": "$", "units": ["$"]}, {"id": "m8u10v3Aq15", "type": "num", "prompt": "When 360 is increased by 40%, what is the absolute change?", "diff": "H", "obj": "O1", "skill": "Application", "pts": 2, "sec": "C · Problem solving", "unit": "×", "units": ["×"], "bare": true}, {"id": "m8u10v3Aq16", "type": "num", "prompt": "A guitar co